  1303→// GetLatestCheckpointIDFromHistory walks backwards from HEAD on the active branch
  1304→// and returns the checkpoint ID from the first commit that has an Entire-Checkpoint trailer.
  1305→// This verifies that condensation actually happened (commit has trailer) without relying
